tered in the field. This module combines guided instruction, interactive activities, and hands-on virtual testing scenarios. Learners practice proper procedures for identifying components, understanding system operation, and performing basic diagnostic checks using industry-standard tools.\n\n**Gas System Fundamentals** \u2013 Learn how common gas fireplace systems are designed, including millivolt and electronic ignition configurations.\n\n**Component Identification**\u2013 Identify key gas components such as valves, pilots, thermocouples, thermopiles, stepper motors, limit switches, and shutoff devices.\n\n**Electrical Testing Procedures** \u2013 Practice safe multimeter use for voltage, resistance, and continuity testing across gas system components.\n\n**Operational Understanding** \u2013 Observe how gas systems operate during startup, normal operation, and shutdown, and how failures affect performance.", "short_description": "**Gas Fireplace Basic Diagnostics** trains users on core skills required to safely understand, inspect, and diagnose common gas fireplace systems encountered in the field. This module combines guided instruction, interactive activities, and hands-on virtual testing scenarios. Learners practice proper procedures for identifying components, understanding system operation, and performing basic diagnostic checks using industry-standard tools."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ftfvr.com/privacy-app", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "From The Future", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://ftfvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": 